{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"DRUPAL-CONTRIB-2026-216","published":"2026-10-07T16:55:41Z","modified":"2026-10-07T20:15:06.001931300Z","aliases":["CVE-2026-107255"],"details":"This module enables you to restrict access to routes by IP address.\n\nThe module doesn't reliably restrict a subset of dynamic routes, leading to an access bypass vulnerability. The impact depends on how a site uses this module and whether it has any routes that are dynamic.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"drupal/restrict_route_by_ip","ecosystem":"Packagist:https://packages.drupal.org/8","purl":"pkg:composer/drupal/restrict_route_by_ip?repository_url=https:%2F%2Fpackages.drupal.org%2F8"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.3.1"}],"database_specific":{"constraint":"<1.3.1"}},{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"2.0.0"},{"fixed":"2.0.1"}],"database_specific":{"constraint":">=2.0.0 <2.0.1"}}],"database_specific":{"affected_versions":"<1.3.1 || >=2.0.0 <2.0.1","source":"https://github.com/DrupalSecurityTeam/drupal-advisory-database/blob/main/advisories/restrict_route_by_ip/DRUPAL-CONTRIB-2026-216.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.drupal.org/sa-contrib-2026-216"}],"credits":[{"name":"Elia Wehbe (ewehbe)","contact":["https://www.drupal.org/u/ewehbe"]}]}